{"seq":3,"slug":"panoptic-segmentation","title":"全景分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/panoptic-segmentation","wordCount":1160,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"全景分割\">全景分割</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>全景分割（Panoptic Segmentation）统一了语义分割和实例分割两大任务，要求模型同时处理图像中的每一个像素：对于可数的&quot;事物&quot;（things，如人、车）需要区分不同实例，对于不可数的&quot;背景&quot;（stuff，如天空、道路）只需语义分类。全景分割为每个像素分配一个语义标签和一个实例 ID，提供了最完整的场景理解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[全景分割] --&gt; B{像素类型}&#10;    B --&gt; C[Things 可数物体]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Stuff 不可数背景]&#10;    C --&gt; E[语义标签 + 实例 ID]&#10;    D --&gt; F[仅语义标签]&#10;    E --&gt; G[统一全景图]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TB\n    A[全景分割] --&gt; B{像素类型}\n    B --&gt; C[Things 可数物体]\n    B --&gt; D[Stuff 不可数背景]\n    C --&gt; E[语义标签 + 实例 ID]\n    D --&gt; F[仅语义标签]\n    E --&gt; G[统一全景图]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>全景质量（Panoptic Quality, PQ）是全景分割的标准评估指标。PQ 同时衡量分割质量和识别质量：PQ = SQ × RQ，其中 SQ（Segmentation Quality）衡量匹配段的 IoU 均值，RQ（Recognition Quality）衡量匹配的 F1-Score。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>骨干网络</th>\n<th>COCO PQ</th>\n<th>Things PQ</th>\n<th>Stuff PQ</th>\n<th>架构特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Panoptic FPN</td>\n<td>ResNet-50-FPN</td>\n<td>39.0</td>\n<td>45.9</td>\n<td>28.7</td>\n<td>双分支融合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Panoptic-DeepLab</td>\n<td>Xception-71</td>\n<td>41.4</td>\n<td>45.1</td>\n<td>35.9</td>\n<td>自下而上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MaskFormer</td>\n<td>Swin-L</td>\n<td>52.7</td>\n<td>58.5</td>\n<td>44.0</td>\n<td>掩码分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mask2Former</td>\n<td>Swin-L</td>\n<td>57.8</td>\n<td>64.2</td>\n<td>48.1</td>\n<td>掩码注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OneFormer</td>\n<td>Swin-L</td>\n<td>58.0</td>\n<td>64.4</td>\n<td>48.6</td>\n<td>多任务统一训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"panoptic-fpn-双分支架构\">Panoptic FPN 双分支架构</h2><p>Panoptic FPN 是最直接的全景分割方案：在 FPN 特征金字塔上构建两个独立的分支——实例分割分支（Mask R-CNN 头）和语义分割分支（密集预测头），然后通过启发式的融合策略将两个分支的输出合并为全景结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class PanopticFPNHead(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, num_things, num_stuff):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.semantic_head = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, 128, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.GroupNorm(32, 128),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(128, num_things + num_stuff, 1),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, fpn_features):&#10;        p2 = fpn_features[&#39;p2&#39;]&#10;        semantic_logits = self.semantic_head(p2)&#10;        return semantic_logits\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PanopticFPNHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, num_things, num_stuff):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.semantic_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.GroupNorm(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_things </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_stuff, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, fpn_features):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fpn_features[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'p2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        semantic_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.semantic_head(p2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> semantic_logits</span></span></code></pre></div><p>融合策略的核心规则是：things 类别的预测以实例分割结果为准（保留实例区分性），stuff 类别以语义分割结果为准。当 things 和 stuff 预测在同一像素上冲突时，置信度高的优先。这种启发式融合虽然有效，但存在两个分支独立优化、目标不一致的问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Panoptic FPN&#10;        A[FPN 特征] --&gt; B[实例分支 Mask R-CNN]&#10;        A --&gt; C[语义分支 FCN]&#10;        B --&gt; D[Things 掩码 + 类别]&#10;        C --&gt; E[Stuff 语义图]&#10;        D --&gt; F[启发式融合]&#10;        E --&gt; F&#10;        F --&gt; G[全景分割结果]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Panoptic FPN\n        A[FPN 特征] --&gt; B[实例分支 Mask R-CNN]\n        A --&gt; C[语义分支 FCN]\n        B --&gt; D[Things 掩码 + 类别]\n        C --&gt; E[Stuff 语义图]\n        D --&gt; F[启发式融合]\n        E --&gt; F\n        F --&gt; G[全景分割结果]\n    end</pre><p>Panoptic-DeepLab 采用自下而上的路线，不使用目标检测器。它在语义分割的基础上，为每个像素预测到所属实例中心的偏移量，然后通过聚类将像素分组为实例。这种方法更加简洁，且在 stuff 类别上表现更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"maskformer-掩码分类范式\">MaskFormer 掩码分类范式</h2><p>MaskFormer 提出了一个革命性的观点：语义分割、实例分割和全景分割本质上都是&quot;掩码分类&quot;问题——为图像生成一组二值掩码，每个掩码对应一个类别标签。这种统一视角使得一个模型可以同时处理三种分割任务。</p>\n<p>MaskFormer 使用 Transformer 解码器生成 N 个 queries，每个 query 预测一个二值掩码和对应的类别。对于语义分割，将同类别的掩码合并；对于实例分割，每个 query 对应一个实例；对于全景分割，things queries 保留实例 ID，stuff queries 合并同类别。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import MaskFormerForInstanceSegmentation&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;model = MaskFormerForInstanceSegmentation.from_pretrained(&quot;facebook/maskformer-swin-base-coco&quot;)&#10;model.eval()&#10;&#10;dummy = torch.randn(1, 3, 800, 800)&#10;with torch.no_grad():&#10;    outputs = model(pixel_values=dummy)&#10;    masks = outputs.masks_queries_logits&#10;    classes = outputs.class_queries_logits&#10;    print(f&quot;查询掩码: {masks.shape}&quot;)&#10;    print(f&quot;查询类别: {classes.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MaskFormerForInstanceSegmentation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MaskFormerForInstanceSegmentation.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"facebook/maskformer-swin-base-coco\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pixel_values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    masks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs.masks_queries_logits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    classes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs.class_queries_logits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"查询掩码: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">masks.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"查询类别: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">classes.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MaskFormer 的训练使用匈牙利匹配算法将预测掩码与真实掩码进行一对一匹配，损失函数包含分类损失（交叉熵）和掩码损失（二值交叉熵 + Dice Loss）。这种集合级别的损失函数与 DETR 类似，避免了传统方法中复杂的正负样本分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开放词汇全景分割\">开放词汇全景分割</h2><p>传统全景分割模型只能识别训练时见过的固定类别集合。开放词汇全景分割（Open-Vocabulary Panoptic Segmentation）将识别能力扩展到任意文本描述的类别，借助 CLIP 等视觉-语言模型的语义对齐能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;&#10;class OpenVocabPanoptic(torch.nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, image_encoder, text_encoder, mask_decoder):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.image_encoder = image_encoder&#10;        self.text_encoder = text_encoder&#10;        self.mask_decoder = mask_decoder&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, images, text_queries):&#10;        image_features = self.image_encoder(images)&#10;        text_features = self.text_encoder(text_queries)&#10;        masks = self.mask_decoder(image_features)&#10;        mask_features = (masks.unsqueeze(2) * image_features.unsqueeze(1)).mean(dim=(-2, -1))&#10;        logits = mask_features @ text_features.T&#10;        return masks, logits\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OpenVocabPanoptic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">torch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, image_encoder, text_encoder, mask_decoder):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.image_encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_encoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.text_encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_encoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask_decoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask_decoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, images, text_queries):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        image_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.image_encoder(images)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        text_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.text_encoder(text_queries)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        masks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask_decoder(image_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mask_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (masks.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_features.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_features.T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> masks, logits</span></span></code></pre></div><p>X-Decoder 和 SEEM 等模型进一步将全景分割与指代分割、图像描述等任务统一，通过自然语言、点击或区域等多种交互方式进行分割。Grounded SAM 将 Grounding DINO 的开放词汇检测能力与 SAM 的精确分割能力结合，实现了&quot;说什么分什么&quot;的交互体验。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>开放词汇</th>\n<th>交互方式</th>\n<th>分割类型</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mask2Former</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全景/实例/语义</td>\n<td>掩码注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X-Decoder</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>文本/区域</td>\n<td>全景+指代</td>\n<td>统一解码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grounded SAM</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>文本+点击</td>\n<td>任意分割</td>\n<td>DINO + SAM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEEM</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>文本/点击/区域</td>\n<td>全景+交互</td>\n<td>多模态提示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((全景分割))&#10;    双分支方法&#10;      Panoptic FPN&#10;      Panoptic-DeepLab&#10;    掩码分类&#10;      MaskFormer&#10;      Mask2Former&#10;      OneFormer&#10;    开放词汇&#10;      X-Decoder&#10;      Grounded SAM&#10;      SEEM\">mindmap\n  root((全景分割))\n    双分支方法\n      Panoptic FPN\n      Panoptic-DeepLab\n    掩码分类\n      MaskFormer\n      Mask2Former\n      OneFormer\n    开放词汇\n      X-Decoder\n      Grounded SAM\n      SEEM</pre><ul>\n<li>全景分割统一了 things 和 stuff 的处理，提供最完整的场景理解</li>\n<li>PQ 指标同时衡量分割质量和识别质量</li>\n<li>MaskFormer 的掩码分类范式统一了三种分割任务，是当前最主流的架构</li>\n<li>Mask2Former 通过掩码注意力在三种任务上都达到了最佳性能</li>\n<li>开放词汇方法借助视觉-语言模型打破了固定类别的限制</li>\n<li>Grounded SAM 实现了文本驱动的任意物体分割，是实际应用中最灵活的方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全景分割","id":"全景分割"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Panoptic FPN 双分支架构","id":"panoptic-fpn-双分支架构"},{"level":2,"text":"MaskFormer 掩码分类范式","id":"maskformer-掩码分类范式"},{"level":2,"text":"开放词汇全景分割","id":"开放词汇全景分割"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实例分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/instance-segmentation"},"next":{"title":"视频分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/video-segmentation"}}